, its type cannot be seen as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked."}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOSuggestionChip/labelModerateSmall(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/labelModerateSmall(_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"labelModerateSmall","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOTheme","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18MISOThemesContract9MISOThemeC"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"labelModerateSmall(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip\/labelmoderatesmall(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Modifies the current "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"label moderate small"}]},{"text":" typography.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The current ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOTheme"},{"text":" must be given in parameter because ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment"},{"text":" property cannot be accessed through an extension or inside a method.","type":"text"}]},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOSuggestionChip":{"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip","title":"MISOSuggestionChip","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}]}}}